---
title: "resyncDiscordMember (stem-system: Discord Re-link for Returning Members)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_auth: supabase.auth.getUser()
    q_auth --> q_no_auth: no user
    q_auth --> q_validate: user present
    q_no_auth --> [*]: return error (login required)
    q_validate --> q_parse: reSyncSchema.safeParse(values)
    q_parse --> q_invalid: parse failed
    q_parse --> q_check_discord: valid
    q_invalid --> [*]: return first field error
    q_check_discord --> q_get_uid: discordUid = user.user_metadata.provider_id
    q_get_uid --> q_no_uid: no discord UID
    q_get_uid --> q_check_member: UID present
    q_no_uid --> [*]: return error (Discord UID unavailable)
    q_check_member --> q_query: select member where user_id and deleted_at is null
    q_query --> q_no_member: not found
    q_query --> q_update_meta: found
    q_no_member --> [*]: return error (member not found, registration required)
    q_update_meta --> q_admin_update: adminClient.auth.admin.updateUserById(metadata with name)
    q_admin_update --> q_update_err: error
    q_admin_update --> q_sync_nick: success
    q_update_err --> [*]: return error (metadata update failed)
    q_sync_nick --> q_sync: syncDiscordNickname(discordUid, fullName)
    q_sync --> q_sync_roles: syncDiscordRoles(discordUid)
    q_sync_roles --> q_revalidate: revalidatePath(/dashboard)
    q_revalidate --> [*]: return success

    note right of q_check_member
        INV-001: only non-deleted members can re-sync
        INV-002: fullName constructed by concatenating last_name + first_name with whitespace removed
    end note
